&lt;h2 id="章节列表"&gt;章节列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第一章 母亲柳青鸾被乡野父子囚禁蹂躏十年，诞下孽种三代乱伦&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二章 道侣苏晴送母子回程被揩油，林霄虐杀畜生父子祭道心&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三章 纵容野种竟生不伦，柳青鸾与野种儿子母子乱伦、孕身奸淫&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第四章 出门游历居然是假！苏晴闭关遭母子奸淫，张小树暴肏元婴，苏晴被彻底控制化为女奴&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第五章 张小树归来，母亲的绝笔信与陌生女奴的调教&lt;/a&gt;
