&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第七章 道侣还是性奴？一门之隔的绿帽隐奸，反差苏晴的质问&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/8" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第八章 林霄旁观木马淫刑默不作声，张小树假意结庐谢罪暗度陈仓&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/9" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第九章 竹庐弟嫂日夜淫行惊风雨，母亲幻化美艳女修献媚色诱乱道心&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/10" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十章 母亲诱堕清纯女修沦为胯下性奴，栽赃诬陷逼宫林霄蒙冤叛宗&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/11" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十一章 宗门沦为极阳淫窟，林霄刺杀功亏一篑，孽母碎骨永囚地牢&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/12" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十二章 散宗门讨淫贼檄文传遍，苏晴承元婴虐刑靠兽精缓解精瘾&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/13" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十三章 淫母献丹欲求乱伦，炼魂血咒万里索命&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/14" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十四章 万里追凶残魂弃壳遁逃，一墙之隔苏晴俯身迎犬&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/d7928ea2c55244a997643b7be0d695d2/reader/15" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十五章 隐山林断恩绝爱悟真谛，感悟传世却变成绿帽法门祖师&lt;/a&gt;
